1106
01:04:50,638 --> 01:04:56,138
Now, in the place that we grew up, it means so much to us.

1107
01:04:56,138 --> 01:05:00,138
But you know, we're no longer puppies, so you know, we're FUWAMOCO!

1108
01:05:00,414 --> 01:05:01,254
Hello, puppies!

1109
01:05:01,314 --> 01:05:02,054
Hah! Hah!

1110
01:05:04,504 --> 01:05:06,204
Actually, there's that thing, right, Mococo?

1111
01:05:06,774 --> 01:05:08,834
Oh! There's something we wanted to tell you!

1112
01:05:11,184 --> 01:05:14,094
It's okay if we go on ahead, right?

1113
01:05:14,704 --> 01:05:16,304
Let's go! Let's go!

1114
01:05:22,280 --> 01:05:23,140
Oh, boy! Oh, boy!

1115
01:05:23,820 --> 01:05:26,760
We're here, right under the Tree of Prominence!

1116
01:05:27,650 --> 01:05:29,170
The Tree of Prominence!

1117
01:05:30,780 --> 01:05:37,550
It's a very special tree to us demon dogs, but especially us demon guardogs!

1118
01:05:37,770 --> 01:05:41,470
And you know, we'd like to sing our last song for today right here!

1119
01:05:41,910 --> 01:05:42,690
Right here!

1120
01:05:43,270 --> 01:05:47,560
You know, and this song means so much to us because it's all for you.

1121
01:05:47,880 --> 01:05:51,870
You know, all of it. Everything is for you.

1122
01:05:52,980 --> 01:05:55,890
Thank you so much, always.

1123
01:05:57,150 --> 01:05:59,820
Well, please listen to our last song for today.

1124
