1138
01:08:19,606 --> 01:08:25,286
きみの瞳に映る わたしは何色ですか
What color am I, reflected in your eyes?

1139
01:08:31,166 --> 01:08:36,986
藍深き望むなら 渡そう高き空を
If you deeply desire indigo, I will bestow upon you the high sky.

1140
01:08:55,386 --> 01:09:00,786
歓びが溢れ 巡りあいました
Joy overflowed, and we met by chance,

1141
01:09:07,286 --> 01:09:12,686
こぼれおつ笑みは 別れを隠す
The overflowing smile hides our parting.

1142
01:09:19,386 --> 01:09:24,686
人はいつしか 朽ち果てるけれど
Though humans will surely wither away one day,

1143
01:09:31,386 --> 01:09:37,186
唄となり 語り継がれてゆくでしょう
surely our song will become a tale passed down through generations.

1144
01:09:46,286 --> 01:09:51,986
きみの瞳に映る わたしは何色ですか
What color am I, reflected in your eyes?

1145
