もろく 儚きものよ
Oh, fragile, fleeting ones,

1149
01:10:47,161 --> 01:10:52,661
強く 美しきものよ
oh, strong, beautiful ones,

1150
01:10:53,661 --> 01:10:59,961
あるがまま ha-
be as you are. Ah...

