1160
01:13:09,661 --> 01:13:14,361
Ah, thank you so much for this!

1161
01:13:14,661 --> 01:13:16,361
Thank you!

1162
01:13:16,361 --> 01:13:21,661
You know, we're not the best at expressing our feelings to you.

1163
01:13:21,961 --> 01:13:24,661
Today is a special day!

1164
01:13:24,961 --> 01:13:29,361
So you know, we did our best,

1165
01:13:29,661 --> 01:13:32,161
and well, we wrote some letters for you.

1166
01:13:32,161 --> 01:13:34,361
Is it okay?

1167
01:13:37,661 --> 01:13:40,361
Do you want to hear them?

1168
01:13:40,961 --> 01:13:42,361
Okay!

1169
01:13:49,161 --> 01:13:55,661
Wow, I'll go first then, okay?

1170
01:13:59,161 --> 01:14:09,161
Dear Ruffians, thank you for all the fluffy headpats, for all your warmth, and for always being here for me during this past year.

1171
01:14:09,161 --> 01:14:22,661
I never would have dreamed that I could be standing here right now, having already done so many amazing things a little more than a year from the day we met,

1172
01:14:22,661 --> 01:14:29,161
but here I am, and it's truly thanks to you.

1173
01:14:29,161 --> 01:14:44,661
There have been so many sunny days and some rainy ones too, but they've all been special and full of meaning because you were there by my side.

1174
01:14:44,661 --> 01:14:48,961
Thank you from the bottom of my heart.

1175
01:14:49,161 --> 01:14:59,161
Please continue to share that beautiful smile of yours with me lots and lots, and I'll make sure that nothing can lay a paw on it! Okay?

1176
01:15:00,568 --> 01:15:05,328
Sincerely, your fluffy Fuwawa~ Bau Bau!

1177
01:15:08,709 --> 01:15:11,009
Bau Bau!

1178
01:15:12,048 --> 01:15:15,508
Ah, next, Mococo-chan's turn!

1179
01:15:15,868 --> 01:15:20,808
My turn? I guess it's my turn then. Hi! I'll do my best! Hi!

1180
01:15:22,084 --> 01:15:24,184
Dear Ruffians,

1181
01:15:24,644 --> 01:15:29,144
I can't believe we're finally here, after so long, I'm so...

1182
01:15:29,904 --> 01:15:33,884
I'm so happy we've been able to spend today together.

1183
01:15:34,104 --> 01:15:43,244
To be honest, there were many hard times, times when we doubted ourselves and were frustrated with our own limits,

1184
01:15:43,644 --> 01:15:49,244
but because you were here by my side with kind words and lots of headpats...

1185
01:15:49,484 --> 01:15:58,504
because you accepted me even when I was maybe a bit needy or being silly, we were able to reach today!

1186
01:16:08,764 --> 01:16:09,824
There's still a lot of growing I have to do, but I hope you can watch me do my best and take even one step forward everyday.

1187
01:16:10,124 --> 01:16:17,104
Because you know, one step forward a day is 7 steps a week! And eventually, that will amount to something amazing.

1188
01:16:17,284 --> 01:16:26,004
And of course, I will always be waiting here for you, ready to protect your smile! Nothing will ever break the pledge we made to you.

1189
01:16:26,324 --> 01:16:34,084
So get ready, because your smile is going to be protected, whether you like it or not! Got it?

1190
01:16:34,284 --> 01:16:39,324
Sincerely, your fluffy Mococo~ Bau Bau!

1191
01:16:42,709 --> 01:16:44,409
Bau Bau!

1192
01:16:45,509 --> 01:16:50,209
Today, another huge dream of ours has come true.

1193
01:16:51,009 --> 01:16:52,709
Thank you so much!

1194
01:16:52,809 --> 01:17:00,709
Always... please let us continue to protect your smiles forever and ever, okay? Forever and ever!

1195
01:17:01,509 --> 01:17:03,009
Bau Bau!

1196
01:17:03,209 --> 01:17:05,709
これからもよろしくね！
Here's to working together from now on!

1197
01:17:06,009 --> 01:17:07,709
Bau Bau!

